# GitHub Personal Access Token (Classic)
# Required for the contribution calendar (private repos, contributions to other repos)
#
# How to create:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens
#   2. Click "Generate new token (classic)"
#   3. Name: "Portfolio Site"
#   4. Expiration: No expiration (or 1 year)
#   5. Scope: check only "read:user"  (no repo write access needed)
#   6. Click "Generate token" and copy the value
#   7. Also go to https://github.com/settings/profile → scroll to
#      "Contributions" → enable "Include private contributions on my profile"
#      so private repo commits appear in the calendar
#
# ⚠️  This token is embedded in the built JS bundle — use read:user scope ONLY.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_your_token_here
